{'symbol': 'MKC', 'date': '2023-05-17 08:00:00', 'title': "MCCORMICK ANNOUNCES MALCOLM SWIFT'S PLAN TO RETIRE", 'text': 'HUNT VALLEY, MD. , MAY 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MCCORMICK & COMPANY, INCORPORATED (NYSE: MKC), A GLOBAL LEADER IN FLAVOR, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MALCOLM SWIFT, PRESIDENT GLOBAL FLAVOR SOLUTIONS AND CHIEF ADMINISTRATIVE OFFICER (CAO), WILL RETIRE AT THE END OF FISCAL YEAR 2023.'}